---
import Base from "../../layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base title="Method">
  <div class="space-y-6">
    <h1 class="text-2xl font-bold text-ib-text">Authority & Evidence Methodology</h1>
    <div class="rounded-xl border border-ib-border bg-ib-surface p-5">
      <p class="text-ib-muted">
        All canonical records in this dataset are backed by evidence anchors that
        point to specific source code locations. Evidence is extracted deterministically
        by static extractors and promoted through a transaction-based canonical pipeline.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="rounded-xl border border-ib-border bg-ib-surface p-5">
      <h2 class="mb-3 text-lg font-semibold text-ib-text">Authority Levels</h2>
      <div class="space-y-3">
        <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
          <span class="rounded-full bg-ib-green/15 px-2.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-semibold text-ib-green">Canonical</span>
          <p class="text-sm text-ib-muted">Sourced from evidence-backed extractors, immutable once promoted.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
          <span class="rounded-full bg-ib-amber/15 px-2.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-semibold text-ib-amber">Laboratory</span>
          <p class="text-sm text-ib-muted">Generated or experimental content, never presented as canonical fact.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="rounded-xl border border-ib-border bg-ib-surface p-5">
      <h2 class="mb-3 text-lg font-semibold text-ib-text">Evidence Policy</h2>
      <p class="text-sm text-ib-muted">
        Public evidence includes locators and short excerpts under CC-BY-4.0.
        Restricted evidence is excluded from projections entirely.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Base>
